      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city serves as the county seat of Belmont County, hosting the historic brick courthouse and jail that once housed seventeen mercantile stores.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Clairsville%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "St. Clairsville lies within the Wheeling metropolitan area, linking it culturally and economically to West Virginia's largest city.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Clairsville%2C_Ohio",
